  "description": "Giwoo, living alone and working as a laborer on an apartment construction site, gradually becomes close to Han-gyeol, a college student who sometimes watches him intently. One day, during a drinking session with Han-gyeol, Giwoo learns that Han-gyeol is still a virgin who hasn’t even kissed anyone.\n\nWithout realizing it, Giwoo lies to make himself seem more experienced, and Han-gyeol teasingly begs him to teach him how to kiss…\n\n“So, you’ve never dated anyone before?”  \n“Um… yeah… I guess.”  \n“Whoa, so you’re a virgin?”\n\n---\n\n**Original Novel:**  \nVolumes: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1632009539), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000121666), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/comma_454_ebook), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=10924353)  \nChapters: [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000121667), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/comma_454), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=10924359) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1632012441), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14301472), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/comma_1118), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/nogada_romance_bl), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000078003), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260369)",
